      en: ["'Trenton Makes, The World Takes' bridge sign", "Old Barracks Museum", "New Jersey State Museum", "New Jersey State House"],
      es: ["Cartel del puente 'Trenton Makes, The World Takes'", "Old Barracks Museum", "New Jersey State Museum", "New Jersey State House"],
      pt: ["Placa da ponte 'Trenton Makes, The World Takes'", "Old Barracks Museum", "New Jersey State Museum", "New Jersey State House"],
